      "t": "Не шуми, пожалуйста, так громко.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not make noise so loudly, please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Я долго искала тебя везде.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I looked for you everywhere for a long time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Садись рядом, выпьешь со мной?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sit down next to me, want a drink with me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Ой, шеф, я же на работе!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, Chef, I am at work after all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
